ent:1.1.10/library-preparation-preflight/claude-code-session-7_05dl24.log`\\n\\nManual next steps:\\n1. Restore or replace the exhausted Claude setup-agent credentials, then rerun artifact discovery and library preflight.\\n2. Verify the discovered repository/source/test/documentation URLs and determine whether meaningful Curator client tests require ZooKeeper or another explicit setup dependency.\\n3. Resume the preserved run from the setup phase and verify that generated tests pass the coordinate-scoped JVM and Native Image lanes.\", \"textSignature\": \"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0ae0810eb138089d016ad7f81f27c087d0a37afa344e8d506b\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"}], \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\", \"provider\": \"openai-codex\", \"model\": \"gpt-5.6-sol\", \"usage\": {\"input\": 2106, \"output\": 854, \"cacheRead\": 104832, \"cacheWrite\": 0, \"reasoning\": 516, \"totalTokens\": 107792, \"cost\": {\"input\": 0.008424, \"output\": 0.01708, \"cacheRead\": 0.041932800000000006, \"cacheWrite\": 0, \"total\": 0.0674368}}, \"stopReason\": \"stop\", \"timestamp\": 1792538642802, \"responseId\": \"resp_0ae0810eb138089d016ad7f81342f487d0bbf4aa31517c63f2\", \"rawStopReason\": \"completed\"}}\n7744:[recv] {\"type\": \"turn_end\", \"message\": {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"thinking\", \"thinking\": \"**Analyzing test_generation_failed causes**\\n\\n**Planning manual artifact verification and workflow resume**\\n\\n**Drafting human intervention instructions**\", \"thinkingSignature\": \"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_0ae0810eb138089d016ad7f814906c87d09a2b98d72870a92c\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"content\\\":[],\\\"encrypted_content\\\":\\\"gAAAAABq1_gf19rUboJmsmI8mvGvChApcKFHw6Ehx4nHsCNFJ_RspqMAs20qrYZFv3XoychtNCoDhIx0Wb_n-r7v6Fq3TKFxIKTyL9C5m6I1OuTWX2XQFGrmV2nCGVvhztxcGS-_qc_rWIarzY0XMVvf535WHjLnFzrji7dCAYcj-etl6NETdEEIGEytHnhtTgDgLXYI2doGz9oOhFzmzR4Y2nrwcRvX5TtSU4QpZntHDvjdIM8k_JXxA1XhZIVfbvBv2kzEZGhfStAyQGOzXX2VmeBcmwagfjLhPYimAIewZOS