urce/documentation details and whether meaningful client tests require ZooKeeper or another deterministic setup dependency.\n3. Confirm generated tests pass the coordinate-scoped JVM and Native Image lanes and produce dynamic-access metrics.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0b6e34558f870c77016ad807bff17487d0909cdc9568a26de5\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 3801, "output": 816, "cacheRead": 78720, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 450, "totalTokens": 83337, "cost": {"input": 0.015203999999999999, "output": 0.01632, "cacheRead": 0.031488, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.063012}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1792542644060, "responseId": "resp_0b6e34558f870c77016ad807b49ea087d0a5ecfa12a42ffe1c", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
